    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9 My Hometown :",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Where I Was Born",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "나는 아름다운 산으로 둘러져있는 작은 마을에서 1970년에 태어났습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I was born in 1970 in a small town, beautiful mountains surrounded it.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "몇해는 어려웠고, 그 겨울은 많은 눈으로 추웠습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Some years were hard and the winters were cold with heavy snow.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "학교까지는 오랫동안 걸어야합니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It was a long walk to get to school.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "나는 자주 등하교 길에 뛰어야만 했습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I often had to run all the way to school and back home.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "때때로 언덕에 오르곤 할 때 충분히 강합니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sometimes I'm strong enough that I used to climb hills.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "나는 요즈음도 길을 뛰고 걷고 할 때 결코 두려워하지 않습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I never get afraid of running or walking along way even these days.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I used to climb hills and trees with friends day and night.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I often had to run all the way to school and back to home.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sometimes I'm strong enough that I used to climbs hills.",
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ],
